      "end": 416399,
      "index": 160
    },
    {
      "text": "他没钱",
      "start": 416399,
      "end": 417269,
      "index": 161
    },
    {
      "text": "你知道吗啊",
      "start": 417269,
      "end": 420310,
      "index": 162
    },
    {
      "text": "人家本来就是什么",
      "start": 420310,
      "end": 422440,
      "index": 163
    },
    {
      "text": "古代有句话",
      "start": 422440,
      "end": 423700,
      "index": 164
    },
    {
      "text": "什么什么衙门",
      "start": 423700,
      "end": 426140,
      "index": 165
    },
    {
      "text": "什么朝朝朝北还是朝南",
